        <article class="article hentry post-8714 patrimoine-culturel type-patrimoine-culturel status-publish"  >
            
    
                    <div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-layout frontend-view alignfull">
        <div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-wrapper wpet-zone-wrapper container"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-layout-zone wpet-zone-header"><div class="wpet-zone-inner"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section is-root open" id="section-1"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body format-list-flex" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value"><p class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value__content reset-margin">Site &#8211; monument                        </p></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value notranslate"><p class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value__content reset-margin">&agrave;                        TOMBLAINE                        </p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-offer-name"><h1 class="wpet-offer-name notranslate">Stade Marcel Picot</h1></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-photo-gallery format-mode-1 wpet-gallery" role="region" aria-label="Galerie photos"><ul class="wpet-gallery__list not-list-style"><li class="wpet-gallery__list__item wpet-gallery__list__item--full"><button aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="fancybox-wpet-gallery" id="wpet-gallery-0" class="not-button-style" data-hc-lightbox="wpet-gallery" data-src="https://cdn.iris-etourism.io/media/destination_nancy/737011371/9501fdb0f0c27cfd.webp" data-caption=""><figure aria-label="Ouvrir dans la galerie: Photo 1" class="twet-h-full"><picture><img src="https://cdn.iris-etourism.io/media/destination_nancy/737011371/9501fdb0f0c27cfd-800x520.webp" alt="Photo 1" width="800" height="520" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync"></picture><figcaption class="figcaption"><span class="sr-only">Photo 1</span></figcaption></figure></button></li><div class="wpet-gallery__widget__list desktop:twet-hidden"><div class="wpet-gallery__widget__item wpet-gallery__widget__item--top-right"><ul class="wpet-gallery__widget__item__icons not-list-style list-flex"><li class="wpet-gallery__widget__item__icons__item"><button data-share="mobile" class="not-button-style"><i class="fiet fiet--wpet-export" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sr-only">Partager sur &#8230;</span></button></li></ul></div></div></ul></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-layout-zone wpet-zone-main"><div data-hc-scrollspy="#anchors" data-hc-scrollspy-shift=200><div class="wpet-zone-inner"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-menu"><nav class="contextual-nav" id="anchors" data-element="contextual-nav" data-cursor="no-drag"><ul class="contextual-nav__list not-list-style swiper-wrapper" data-cursor="no-drag"><li class="contextual-nav__item swiper-slide" data-menu-item-ref='#a-propos'><a href="#a-propos" data-hc-scrollspy-nav-item data-trigger="anchor" class="not-link-style contextual-nav__item__link" data-menu-item-active='true'>&Agrave; propos</a></li><li class="contextual-nav__item swiper-slide" data-menu-item-ref='#prestations'><a href="#prestations" data-hc-scrollspy-nav-item data-trigger="anchor" class="not-link-style contextual-nav__item__link" data-menu-item-active='true'>Prestations</a></li></ul><div class="contextual-nav-slider-buttons"><div class="contextual-nav-slider-button contextual-nav-slider-button-prev ficore ficore--chevron-left" data-element="contextual-nav-slider-button-prev"></div><div class="contextual-nav-slider-button contextual-nav-slider-button-next ficore ficore--chevron-right" data-element="contextual-nav-slider-button-next"></div></div></nav></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section is-root open" id="a-propos"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-text format-classic"><p class="reset-margin">Avec plus de 20 000 places assises, des &eacute;quipements d&eacute;di&eacute;s &agrave; la presse, des salons d&#039;honneur, un Club House des supporters ou encore une &laquo; rue &raquo; conviviale am&eacute;nag&eacute;e sous la tribune Hazotte, le stade Marcel Picot, th&eacute;&acirc;tre des rencontres de l&#039;AS Nancy-Lorraine, est une enceinte moderne d&eacute;volue au football implant&eacute;e sur le territoire &agrave; enjeux des Plaines Rive Droite et d&eacute;sormais dot&eacute;e d&#039;une pelouse synth&eacute;tique.<br/>Au pied de l&rsquo;enceinte d&rsquo;honneur, « Picot » propose également deux terrains annexes où évoluent la réserve professionnelle de l&rsquo;ASNL, les associations et les scolaires de l&rsquo;agglomération.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section is-root" id="prestations"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-header" data-trigger="wpet-collapse-toggle"><h2 class="h2">Prestations</h2></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-header" data-trigger="wpet-collapse-toggle"><h3 class="h4">Accueil animaux</h3></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value"><p class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-icon-label-value__content reset-margin">Les animaux ne sont pas accept&eacute;s                        </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-layout-zone wpet-zone-aside"><div class="wpet-zone-inner"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section format-sticky is-root open" id="section-10"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section open"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-section-body format-no-space" data-element="wpet-collapse"><div class="wp-block-wp-etourisme-v3-map"><div class="iris-map" data-iris-map='{&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;lat&quot;:48.695721300000002,&quot;lng&quot;:6.211436,&quot;popup&quot;:&quot;&amp;lt;div  class=&amp;quot;iris-card  iris-card--infobox iris-card--hover-effect-fade&amp;quot; data-layer-wpet-offer-id=&amp;quot;